  "prefLabel": "Env-WMC 206.02 Filing",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WMC 206.02 Filing. Any person wishing to petition the council to amend, adopt, or repeal a rule shall file the original and one copy of the petition with the council clerk as provided in Env-WMC 203.09(a).\n\nSource. #8031, eff 1-24-04",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wmc200.html"
